        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Hide completed sessions by default",
        "body": "Closes #881.\n\nAdds a persisted Show completed toggle on the Sessions page and hides clean completed sessions by default. Failed, killed, timeout, running, unknown, and aborted sessions stay visible. The new toggle label is wired through the existing localization resources.\n\n## Validation\nFocused tray tests for session visibility, settings round-trip, and localization passed locally. Full Windows build and test validation is expected to run in CI; local macOS validation is blocked because build.ps1 requires Windows and existing Windows-path and exec tests fail off-Windows.\n\n## Real behavior proof\nUnit proof covers done and completed sessions hidden by default, failed/killed/timeout/running/unknown/aborted sessions visible, and Show completed preserving all sessions. Visible WinUI proof is not available on this macOS host.",
